op in a  car to see the actor's progress for  himself it was during this final exam of  sorts that Bale was really put to the  test  eze Nagel joined bail on the track and  intentionally placed pressure on him to  see how well he could hold his composure  and focus on the road if you're gonna  push a piece of machinery to the limit  and expect it to hold together you have  to have some sense of where that limit  is Nagel shared the last day of training  we finished in real racecars one of the  tests that I do to whomever I'm training  is to see how well they stay focused to  see if I can distract them if they start  paying more attention to my car than  they are their own car then mistakes  start to happen Nagel didn't go easy on  bail just because he's a big-name actor  he admitted quotes i hounded him pretty  hard  I was inches off his gearbox and trying  to fill his mirrors left and right doing  everything I could to distract him  according to Nagel Bale managed to keep  his cool and complete the task without  any punch he passed the test with flying  colors and quotes never bobbled once  Nagel praised bales professionalism  during training he admitted he's  hands-down the best actor I've ever  trained coming from a pro like Nagel  that's quite a compliment all of that  training paid off big when it came time  to shoot poured versus Ferrari thanks to  his extensive training Bale knew exactly  which car was supposed to be doing  during poured vs. Ferraris Racing's  allowing him to react accordingly while  driving additionally his work at the  Bondurant high-performance driving  school actually led to some real time  behind the wheel on screen as Nagel  shared with looper because of the  training we did with him I felt very  comfortable putting Christian in the car  so he did Nagel revealed that the tie  and Ford versus Ferrari when you see  miles quote come screaming into the pits  and jump out of the car or jump into the  car and merge into traffic that's going  100 150 miles an hour aren't fake and  they're not the work of a stuntman  either Nagle confessed that's Christian  you can't fake that  some of the cars used in the movie were  remarkably close to the real thanks to  creating an even greater sense of  authenticity Nagle explained there's a  company called super performance and  they're actually licensed to make what  they call continuation copies of the  gt40 we had a few of those yes that  means the cars you see in the movie have  the same engine a Ford 427 is the one  that miles actually drove and yes it was  just as impressive and fun to handle and  niggles words it was quotes quite a  beast drive and we can only imagine Ford  versus Ferrari is in theaters now check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite stuff or coming soon subscribe  to our YouTube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one
 

